  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAPACITY IOM Regional Activities: Immigration and Borders (IB) 2025-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the framework of the IOM &#x2013; Denmark Migration Management Programme&#x2019;s Outcome 2 Dialogue, Partnership and Coordination for Migration Management, IOM will carry out regional and cross-regional initiatives aimed at fostering cooperation and coordination amongst countries of origin, transit and destination on migration-related matters. The aim is to unfold good examples and foster good practices of coordinated and cooperative approaches to migration management and governance, while generating dialogue on common interests and goals.</narrative>
  </description>
